  "scopeClarifications": [
    "Controller metadata declares its primary Mart feature consistently; the shared service gate still enforces Mart, FoodDelivery and Warehouse flags together for every operation.",
    "A digest-bound persisted mart RDB state copy must not replay warehouse inventory or outbound business commands; bind header state/stage too so explicit community edits keep their existing projection path.",
    "Exclude all mart aliases before the food offer query limit; mart work cannot hide existing food offers.",
    "Protect the first driver-accept race during legacy mart projection with serializable SQL checks and pending retry, without claiming atomic cross-store ordering.",
    "Existing mart Mongo sync and WarehouseOutbound child outbox must reread the current mart driver attempt and cannot overwrite its SQL lifecycle or replay an earlier captured stage.",
    "Use a single outbound per full available inventory lot; reserved, split and shared lot inference remains unsupported.",
    "Slip issuance before packing is allowed by existing r56 intent; pickup still requires complete current picking and packing.",
    "Successful mart actions append only Action, Revision and opaque RequestId to the existing SQL transport event in the same transaction.",
    "Confirmed structured command rejection is distinct from an unknown result; GET request-not-found never authorizes automatic POST replay.",
    "Native screen compile and view-model tests do not claim actual MAUI rendering or physical device verification.",
    "Regenerate the existing food-driver code map after source/menu changes; do not edit generated output manually."
  ],
